OL,3,AJapan warns of floods and landslides
OL,4,Aaround Tokyo as powerful typhoon
OL,5,Aapproaches
OL,6,
OL,7,FJapan is bracing for record rainfall
OL,8,Ffrom a powerful typhoon expected to
OL,9,Fmove close to Tokyo and surrounding
OL,10,Fareas on the country's eastern coast
OL,12,FLandslides and floods are feared as
OL,13,FTyphoon Dujuan is expected to bring up
OL,14,Fto 350mm of rain to the Tokai region,
OL,15,F300mm to the Kanto and Izu Islands, and
OL,16,F200mm to Tohoku
OL,18,FSome 300 flights have been cancelled
OL,19,Fand some train services suspended
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
