OL,3,AJapan warns of floods and landslides
OL,4,Aaround Tokyo as powerful typhoon
OL,5,Aapproaches
OL,6,
OL,7,FDujuan, Japan's 25th storm of the year,
OL,8,Fis packing sustained winds of 126km/h
OL,9,F(78.3mph) and gusts of up to 180km/h
OL,11,FIt is the latest in a wave of
OL,12,Fback-to-back storms in the Pacific,
OL,13,Fmade more intense by this year's "super
OL,14,FEl Nino", which has warmed the ocean
OL,15,Fand fuelled the formation of storms
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
